<view class="community"><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error" bindtap="load">{{error}} · 点击重试</view><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="muted">正在加载资料…</view><block wx:if="{{profile}}"><view class="profile-heading"><view class="title">用户资料</view><profile-actions user-id="{{profile.id}}"/></view><view class="card"><view class="between"><image wx:if="{{profile.avatarUrl}}" class="avatar" src="{{profile.avatarUrl}}" mode="aspectFill"/><view wx:else class="avatar">{{profile.nickname[0]||'用'}}</view><view class="grow"><view class="title">{{profile.nickname}}</view><view class="badge">{{profile.role==='ENGINEER'?'工程师':'客户'}}</view></view></view></view><view class="notice">仅展示对方公开的基础资料。手机号、实名信息及内部评价不对外展示。</view><button wx:if="{{profile.role==='ENGINEER'}}" class="primary" bindtap="engineer">查看专业资料与案例 ›</button></block></view>
